# What the Vercel CLI excludes from an upload.
#
# Kept separate from .gitignore ON PURPOSE: the CLI honours .vercelignore in
# preference to .gitignore, and `ring/` must be UPLOADED while staying out of
# git (it is a build artifact, rebuilt by `npm run deploy`). Listing the same
# exclusions here, minus ring/, makes the upload independent of git's view.
.vercel/
.env
.env*
node_modules/
.DS_Store
